<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>I</i> knew.</font>

50
00:02:43,420 --> 00:02:45,070
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">See?</font>

51
00:02:45,070 --> 00:02:49,130
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It's because you make so many unnecessary
