52
00:02:52,940 --> 00:02:55,580
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>What the heck's going on?!</i></font>

53
00:02:55,580 --> 00:03:00,570
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Y- Yamucha-san can't even</i>
<i>lay a finger on the guy!</i></font>

54
00:03:05,030 --> 00:03:07,590
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yamucha-<i>sama</i>...</font>

55
00:03:07,590 --> 00:03:11,440
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What are you doing out there?!
Get it together!</font>

56
00:03:11,440 --> 00:03:15,340
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Damn it, Yamucha! Pull yourself together!</font>

57
00:03:17,280 --> 00:03:19,960
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You're asking him to do the impossible...</font>

58
00:03:19,960 --> 00:03:23,400
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">His opponent is just too formidable!</font>

59
00:03:51,230 --> 00:03:52,860
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'm over here!</font>

60
