62
00:04:04,660 --> 00:04:08,490
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It makes it especially hard to
dodge your opponent's attacks.</font>

63
00:04:09,560 --> 00:04:13,560
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">T-That man... he couldn't be!</font>

64
00:04:17,400 --> 00:04:22,140
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What the hell?! You're practically
dealing with me like I'm a baby...</font>

65
00:04:22,140 --> 00:04:26,310
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">No, no, you are indeed quite strong!</font>

66
00:04:26,310 --> 00:04:28,580
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I can tell this from the way you move.</font>

67
00:04:28,580 --> 00:04:34,320
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Unfortunately, I am simply
much stronger than you are.</font>

68
00:04:34,320 --> 00:04:38,420
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Go train some more.
You can still catch up to me yet!</font>

69
00:04:38,430 --> 00:04:40,360
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What?!</font>

70
00:04:40,360 --> 00:04:46,390
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">This is just between you and me,
