71
00:04:48,570 --> 00:04:51,270
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I sure wasn't expecting you
to say anything like <i>that</i>...</font>

72
00:04:51,270 --> 00:04:55,170
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Don't tell me you're some sort
of space alien or something...</font>

73
00:04:55,180 --> 00:04:57,340
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Maybe, maybe not.</font>

74
00:04:57,340 --> 00:05:08,930
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">All I <i>can</i> tell you is that I've... borrowed
this person's body for a little while.</font>

75
00:05:08,930 --> 00:05:15,300
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Simply put, I've transferred
my spirit into this body.</font>

76
00:05:17,980 --> 00:05:20,240
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Transferred his spirit?!</font>

77
00:05:20,250 --> 00:05:24,380
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Eh? What is it? What did he say?</font>

78
00:05:24,380 --> 00:05:27,680
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I can't hear him, he's talking too quietly...</font>

79
00:05:29,520 --> 00:05:32,720
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You're mumbling a
bunch of random nonsense.</font>

80
00:05:32,720 --> 00:05:37,130
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It doesn't make the slightest
difference to me, though.</font>

81
00:05:37,130 --> 00:05:42,630
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">After all, it doesn't change the fact that
