82
00:05:42,630 --> 00:05:45,240
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Dammit, I've got no other choice...</font>

83
00:05:45,240 --> 00:05:47,500
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I was hoping to save this technique
