85
00:05:59,080 --> 00:06:01,390
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Thanks for the all the advice.</font>

86
00:06:01,390 --> 00:06:04,120
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It's given me a lot of food for thought!</font>

87
00:06:04,120 --> 00:06:09,150
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">But in the end, I <i>will</i>
be the one who wins!</font>

88
