138
00:11:31,690 --> 00:11:33,380
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Try your best!</font>

139
00:11:35,260 --> 00:11:36,890
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Right!</font>

140
00:11:49,060 --> 00:11:56,000
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">These two last fought in the
