141
00:11:56,000 --> 00:11:59,400
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">which ended in a victory for Tenshinhan!</font>

142
00:11:59,410 --> 00:12:03,470
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What will happen <i>this</i> tournament?!</font>

143
00:12:10,390 --> 00:12:13,160
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You're going to go all out from
