145
00:12:40,250 --> 00:12:43,050
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Goku's finally gonna fight for real!</font>

146
00:12:43,050 --> 00:12:45,550
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Is his opponent strong?</font>

147
00:12:45,560 --> 00:12:48,490
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yeah. Unbelievably strong.</font>

148
00:12:49,760 --> 00:12:54,420
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I suppose I'll watch and
