150
00:13:07,080 --> 00:13:10,640
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Let the match begin!</font>

151
00:13:38,640 --> 00:13:42,980
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Both fighters have taken to the sky!</font>

152
00:14:08,240 --> 00:14:12,170
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Tenshinhan has caught up with Son Goku!</font>

153
00:14:12,180 --> 00:14:16,540
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">The two are locked in an
