155
00:14:55,050 --> 00:15:00,010
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Eerily, only the sounds of
their fighting can be heard!</font>

156
00:15:05,730 --> 00:15:09,130
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He's fast. He possesses significant speed.</font>

157
00:15:12,120 --> 00:15:16,000
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Amazing! They're both fighting
at exactly the same level!</font>

158
00:15:16,000 --> 00:15:17,360
