159
00:15:17,360 --> 00:15:22,320
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Eh? You two... can see them?</font>

160
00:16:10,740 --> 00:16:13,610
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You fell for the oldest trick in the book!</font>

161
00:16:30,620 --> 00:16:33,360
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What another astonishing match
