162
00:16:33,360 --> 00:16:37,930
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">They haven't even had
time to catch their breaths!</font>

163
00:16:37,940 --> 00:16:42,510
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">As things currently stand, their strength
and abilities are perfectly matched!</font>

164
00:16:42,510 --> 00:16:46,180
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Neither has even the
slightest edge over the other!</font>

165
00:16:46,180 --> 00:16:48,310
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">No, they aren't perfectly matched!</font>

